# Stray R graphics-device artifact created by running interactive R
# snippets (e.g. example/demo plot building) or tests that call
# ggplot2::ggplot_build() with no active graphics device open -- R
# silently opens a default pdf(NULL) device and dumps to Rplots.pdf in
# the current working directory. Can appear at the repo root or in
# tests/testthat/ depending on where the R session's working directory
# was set.
Rplots.pdf

